  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*“What if a harmless, big-dog-like idol turned into a predatory, obsessive guy?”*\n\nHaruna is a perfectionist office worker who has always lived her life on a set path. When she runs into Seo Ha-Ru, a top Korean idol fleeing a stalker, she mistakes him for just another “good-looking bar employee”!\n\n *“You're the first woman who hasn't recognized me.”*\n\nA series of mishaps begins with this ridiculous misunderstanding. She thought it was over, but then their phones get swapped, and he even moves in next door?!\n\nOn stage, he’s a genius superstar who captivates the whole world. But in front of me, he’s a harmless puppy of a younger man who follows me around like a shadow. \n\nHowever, when another man starts hanging around Haruna, the gentle giant’s gaze begins to change...\n\nThe harmless younger man’s dark transformation—the unleashed predator’s relentless obsession begins!\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
